The {{Term/Store|Of the Sky Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 404"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Hero of the Sky Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 193"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Hero of the Sky Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Cap of the Sky]], [[Tunic of the Sky]], and [[Trousers of the Sky]]. All three pieces can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SS|-}} Link amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain one of the pieces. As the amiibo can only be scanned once per real-world day, a player must collect the set over three or more real-world days. 

The set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the [[Set Bonus#Master Sword Beam Up|Master Sword Beam Up]] [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set. It resembles Link's outfit from {{SS}}. 

====Enhancing====
{{Armor Set Pieces|BotW|Hero of the Sky Set}}
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
The Of the Sky Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Cap of the Sky]], [[Tunic of the Sky]], and [[Trousers of the Sky]]. The Armor Set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When the whole Armor Set is worn together and has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the [[Set Bonus#Attack Up|Attack Up Set Bonus]].

